// Villain Def - Council_Nebula_Soldier 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2277611286" "New Council recruits are placed in the ranks of the Nebula, the lowest of the organization's Outer Bands. There they will either prove themselves worthy to learn the secrets of the Council, or else they will die in combat. Either way, they serve the Council's purposes."
// DisplayNames :
"P4248575859" "Nebula Rifle"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Nebula_Soldier_Missle 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P4048180518" "Nebula Rocket"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Nebula_Soldier_Grenade 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3152592153" "New Council recruits are placed in the ranks of the Nebula, the lowest of the organization's Outer Bands. There they will either prove themselves worthy to learn the secrets of the Council, or else they will die in combat. Either way, they serve their master's purposes."
// DisplayNames :
"P1121822913" "Nebula Grenade"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
