"P3514853006" "Nebula Force"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Nebula_Soldier_Martial_Arts 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P2855192531" "Nebula Fist"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Nebula_Soldier_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3551522110" "Only those Nebula soldiers who have proven both resilient and trustworthy achieve the rank of Adjutant. Through their skill in combat and their dedication to the Council's cause, they have begun to earn real respect from their masters. In return, they receive better equipment and training, and are trusted with some low level secrets."
// DisplayNames :
"P3484712350" "Nebula Adjutant"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Nebula_Soldier_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1368551295" "To ascend to the rank of Archon, a Nebula soldier must prove himself over the course of many battles. Many of them resent having to continue working with raw recruits, but this indignity is more than compensated for by their first taste of super soldier serums and body enhancements. Combined with their combat experience, these enhancements make them formidable foes."
// DisplayNames :
"P3920877961" "Nebula Archon"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Nebula_Elite 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3802503696" "Once a soldier has proven his total commitment to the Council, he is transferred into the ranks of the Elite. Only one in five soldiers survive long enough to achieve this promotion. Nebula Elites receive first stage super soldier serum that improves their physical prowess to the level of Olympic athletes. They also go through training courses before being put back into the battle lines. After all, the Council has made an investment in their success."
// DisplayNames :
"P1941807548" "Nebula Elite Rifle"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Nebula_Elite_Missle 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2642190992" "Once a soldier has proven his total commitment to the cause, he is transferred into the ranks of the Elite. Only one in five soldiers survive long enough to achieve this promotion. Nebel Elites receive first stage super soldier serum that improves their physical prowess to the level of Olympic athletes. They also go through training courses before being put back into the battle lines. After all, the 5th Column has made an investment in their success."
// DisplayNames :
"P4196338617" "Nebula Elite Rocket"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Nebula_Elite_Grenade 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P577139530" "Nebula Elite Grenade"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Nebula_Elite_Flamethrower 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P3872710909" "Nebula Elite Fire"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Nebula_Elite_Chaingun 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P1593956417" "Nebula Elite Force"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Nebula_Elite_Martial_Arts 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P2508190030" "Nebula Elite Fist"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Nebula_Elite_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2560055577" "A high-ranking Nebula Elite Adjutant is a force to be reckoned with. His increased physical prowess is now matched by improved tactical skills and the steely resolve of a combat veteran. Regular doses of super soldier serum has left him entirely devoted to the Council's cause. He is willing to follow any order, and he seldom worries about the messy consequences."
// DisplayNames :
"P3049168109" "Nebula Elite Adjutant"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Nebula_Elite_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1587690640" "The leaders of the Nebula Elite are near perfect soldierly specimens. In addition to the normal super soldier serum, they receive a special formula that enhances intellect and problem solving skills. An Elite Archon is utterly devoted to the Council's plans for world domination, and he can finally be trusted to lead his soldiers without direction from above."
// DisplayNames :
"P3806758678" "Nebula Elite Archon"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Nebula_Cor_Leonis_Thug 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P290053632" "A Cor Leonis is a Council soldier who has undergone a long and painful regimen of super soldier treatments. The Nebula Cor Leonis are the most numerous of these medical marvels, but that doesn't mean they're common. They've had extensive training and thousands of dollars worth of drugs pumped into them. It's an investment that usually pays off, since a first rank Cor Leonis is stronger than five normal men."
// DisplayNames :
"P4261152248" "Nebula Cor Leonis Rifle"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Nebula_Cor_Leonis_Missle 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P2334183316" "Nebula Cor Leonis Rocket"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Nebula_Cor_Leonis_Grenade 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P1741164795" "Nebula Cor Leonis Grenade"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Nebula_Cor_Leonis_Flamethrower 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P429874528" "Nebula Cor Leonis Fire"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Nebula_Cor_Leonis_Chaingun 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P3510664197" "Nebula Cor Leonis Force"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Nebula_Cor_Leonis_Martial_Arts 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P1781812435" "Nebula Cor Leonis Fist"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Nebula_Cor_Leonis_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3873572121" "The pinnacle of frontline soldiers, the Cor Leonis Adjutants are nearly unstoppable fighting machines. It often takes an anti-tank weapon just to faze one of these juggernauts. Fortunately, their numbers are small, though the Council keeps making more of them as their soldiers become more experienced."
// DisplayNames :
"P161329556" "Nebula Cor Leonis Adjutant"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Nebula_Cor_Leonis_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2863355557" "The highest ranking soldiers among the Nebula, the Nebula Cor Leonis Archons are strikingly capable field officers, able to formulate and execute grand military campaigns. Unlike most modern officers, these Cor Leonis are not afraid to personally lead their soldiers into battle. After all, their own abilities far surpass those of all normal men and many super-powered heroes."
// DisplayNames :
"P2480489275" "Nebula Cor Leonis Archon"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Soldier 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3123804481" "The Penumbra is the Council's special operations division, tasked with covert ops, assassinations, and espionage. Even the lowest level recruits receive some special training, particularly in stealth and evasion techniques. New recruits must have some military or law enforcement experience before being accepted into the Penumbra."
// DisplayNames :
"P2245610004" "Penumbra Rifle"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Soldier_Missle 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P585385096" "Penumbra Rocket"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Soldier_Grenade 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P1935706175" "Penumbra Grenade"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Soldier_Flamethrower 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P991499048" "Penumbra Fire"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Soldier_Chaingun 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P2841981929" "Penumbra Force"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Soldier_Martial_Arts 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P1219625627" "Penumbra Fist"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Soldier_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3654489165" "The Penumbra Adjutants have completed their covert ops training and are on the verge of being promoted to Elite status. They have yet to benefit from a course of super soldier serum, but they have honed their stealth and physique to a near perfect level. Adjutants are often tasked with leading squads of Penumbra soldiers on raids to raise funds for the Council."
// DisplayNames :
"P2508201893" "Penumbra Adjutant"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Soldier_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P247081773" "A Penumbra Archon is responsible for overseeing squads of covert operatives. Since coverts ops need to be precise and perfectly executed, a Penumbra Archon is valued chiefly for his ability to follow orders precisely and make sure his troops do the same. In return for loyalty and good service, Archons receive their first taste of super soldier serum, making them stronger and quicker than any normal human could be."
// DisplayNames :
"P975030311" "Penumbra Archon"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Elite 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2389236056" "The Penumbra Elites are world-class special forces operatives, as well trained as any Navy SEAL. They're expert insurgents, capable of infiltrating a target swiftly and silently, then taking it down. Elites undergo a basic super soldier regimen designed to heighten their stealth, accuracy, and concentration. These enhancements make them incredibly dangerous, especially when encountered in force."
// DisplayNames :
"P771511815" "Penumbra Elite Rifle"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Elite_Missle 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P2800885834" "Penumbra Elite Rocket"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Elite_Grenade 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P109985223" "Penumbra Elite Grenade"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Elite_Flamethrower 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P2044351877" "Penumbra Elite Fire"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Elite_Chaingun 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P20983802" "Penumbra Elite Force"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Elite_Martial_Arts 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P175195190" "Penumbra Elite Fist"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Elite_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P42071791" "A Penumbra Elite at the peak of his game may earn the rank of Adjutant, and with it a large upgrade in super soldier serum. He is on the verge of Cor Leonis status, and his mind has become focused with laser-like intensity. High ranking Elites are some of the best shots and most dedicated insurgents in the world. They can, and have, assassinated heads of state as well as world famous heroes. "
// DisplayNames :
"P647203646" "Penumbra Elite Adjutant"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Elite_Sniper 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2608654338" "Those gifted with incredible accuracy are quickly transferred into the Penumbra division, where they undergo lengthy treatments to refine their abilities. The Sharpshooters are natural loners and disdain associating with the rank and file. The only praise they seek is the satisfaction of a silent kill."
// DisplayNames :
"P22536681" "Penumbra Elite Sharpshooter"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Elite_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1649260699" "While most Elites concentrate on learning the basic skills required for special ops, the Archons receive additional training in tactics. They're also trained in technological skills, such as wire tapping and circumventing security systems. Combined with their prodigious super soldier enhancements, these skills make Elite Archons well-prepared to plan and carry out small covert ops."
// DisplayNames :
"P3188436197" "Penumbra Elite Archon"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Elite_Boss_Lycanthrope 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Cor_Leonis 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P757862208" "The Cor Leonis of the Penumbra have transcended mere special ops status. They are each unto themselves a powerful covert force, capable of taking on operations that would normally require an entire team of commandos. In addition to their enhanced physical and mental attributes, they receive training in security systems, computer infiltration, and surveillance equipment. In many ways, they are the perfect spies."
// DisplayNames :
"P3560605134" "Penumbra Cor Leonis Rifle"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Cor_Leonis_Missle 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P1152621709" "Penumbra Cor Leonis Rocket"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Cor_Leonis_Grenade 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P57420648" "Penumbra Cor Leonis Grenade"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Cor_Leonis_Flamethrower 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P114750233" "Penumbra Cor Leonis Fire"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Cor_Leonis_Chaingun 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P4169595955" "Penumbra Cor Leonis Force"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Cor_Leonis_Martial_Arts 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P1971184298" "Penumbra Cor Leonis Fist"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Cor_Leonis_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3187768755" "Unlike their counterparts in the other branches of the Council's hierarchy, the Penumbra Cor Leonis Adjutants have considerable autonomy. The Council feels that the subversive activities that fall within the Penumbra's purview require a certain amount of independence. This makes the Penumbra Cor Leonis quite unpredictable at times - and thus, quite deadly."
// DisplayNames :
"P1627379537" "Penumbra Cor Leonis Adjutant"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Cor_Leonis_Lycanthrope_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Cor_Leonis_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P433660733" "The Penumbra Cor Leonis Archons author their own plans to sow terror and fear across Paragon City. Many are in command of small military cells, completely cut off from their compatriots - both for the sake of security, and to encourage independent thinking. "
// DisplayNames :
"P1548357666" "Penumbra Cor Leonis Archon"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vortex_Soldier 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2562360972" "The Vortex are the pride and joy of the Council's army. They represent the ideal to which all other followers of the Council should aspire. Not only are they disciplined, well-trained soldiers;, but their faith in the Council's supremacy is complete. Only those who have proven both their ability and loyalty are permitted to join the ranks of the Vortex."
// DisplayNames :
"P3361442664" "Vortex Rifle"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vortex_Soldier_Missle 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P2065365854" "Vortex Rocket"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vortex_Soldier_Grenade 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P478740833" "Vortex Grenade"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vortex_Soldier_Flamethrower 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P196687688" "Vortex Fire"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vortex_Soldier_Chaingun 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P3840406165" "Vortex Force"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vortex_Soldier_Martial_Arts 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P2014455547" "Vortex Fist"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vortex_Soldier_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3191738353" "Vortx Adjutants are zealots in every sense of the word. They believe in the Council's superiority so fiercely that they have become experts at recruiting new members from the disaffected elements of society. Vortex Adjutants are in equal parts soldier and proselytizer. "
// DisplayNames :
"P423398111" "Vortex Adjutant"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vortex_Soldier_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1687354221" "The Vortex Archons are the living essence of the Council's beliefs. While the Adjutants brim with enthusiasm, the Archons radiate a palpable aura of danger. The Vortex carefully foster this mystique in order to keep order within the ranks of the Council."
// DisplayNames :
"P1675851761" "Vortex Archon"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vortex_Elite 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3963454662" "Elite members of the Vortex have not only proven their loyalty to the cause, they've also shown themselves capable of bringing new members into the fold. Only those who have achieved Elite status are allowed to interact directly with potential recruits. Their fanatical devotion ensures that they'll either convert the potential member, or kill him. Either way, the secrets of the Council remain secure."
// DisplayNames :
"P3128638197" "Vortex Elite Rifle"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vortex_Elite_Missle 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P4124455958" "Vortex Elite Rocket"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vortex_Elite_Grenade 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P1677722636" "Vortex Elite Grenade"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vortex_Elite_Flamethrower 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P745484174" "Vortex Elite Fire"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vortex_Elite_Chaingun 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P2529641224" "Vortex Elite Force"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vortex_Elite_Martial_Arts 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P1606696509" "Vortex Elite Fist"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vortex_Elite_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P197207903" "The Elite Vortex Adjutants are those destined for positions of authority in the Council hierarchy. Their authority supercedes nearly every other rank. These Adjutants reward the Council with the utmost devotion. By the time someone has reached this lofty level, he has given up any semblance of a normal life. He belongs to the Council, body and soul."
// DisplayNames :
"P709303871" "Vortex Elite Adjutant"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vortex_Elite_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3671742404" "The Vortex Elite Archons are among the few soldiers permitted to express their opinions to the Council's leaders, though most wisely avoid doing so. They control almost all the internal operations of the Council organization."
// DisplayNames :
"P3979327673" "Vortex Elite Archon"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vortex_Cor_Leonis 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1717286058" "Every member of the Council aspires to become one of the Vortex Cor Leonis, but few of them achieve this lofty goal. They are the spiritual and philosophical leaders of the Council - totally devoted to its goal of world domination. Like any good soldier, they lead by example. Their intense training and physical enhancements make them perfect soldiers. In battle, they serve as an inspiration to all who fight at their side. "
// DisplayNames :
"P1296359312" "Vortex Cor Leonis Rifle"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vortex_Cor_Leonis_Missle 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P3371802148" "Vortex Cor Leonis Rocket"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vortex_Cor_Leonis_Grenade 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P2901047846" "Vortex Cor Leonis Grenade"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vortex_Cor_Leonis_Flamethrower 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P1910314778" "Vortex Cor Leonis Fire"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vortex_Cor_Leonis_Chaingun 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P1643685485" "Vortex Cor Leonis Force"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vortex_Cor_Leonis_Martial_Arts 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P41289385" "Vortex Cor Leonis Fist"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vortex_Cor_Leonis_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P764822004" "Vortex Cor Leonis Adjutants have the responsibility of leading large numbers of troops. They are concerned with training their men into peak fighting form - and recruiting new members to the Council. Until recently, none have ever been taken alive by the authorities."
// DisplayNames :
"P4046732695" "Vortex Cor Leonis Adjutant"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vortex_Cor_Leonis_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2321436282" "The Vortex Cor Leonis Archons make up the inner circle that surrounds the Council leadership. They are charged with the grand stratagems that further the ultimate goal of the Council: the eventual domination of the world. The leaders of the Council foster a competitiveness between these high ranking officers in order to prevent any single one of them from acquiring too much power and becoming a threat."
// DisplayNames :
"P3489665675" "Vortex Cor Leonis Archon"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Fifth_Mek_Man 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P126139654" "Vandal, the genius behind the Council's technology, created the first Mek Men during the 1940's. He's been improving on them ever since. The tough and deadly versions in operation today are 100 times more dangerous than their predecessors of 60 years ago. Modern Mek Men have tough, thick armor, redundant systems that resist damage, and a powerful onboard AI that makes them faster and smarter than most human soldiers. "
// DisplayNames :
"P16233574" "Mek Man"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Fifth_Hoverbot 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2889042091" "The Steel Valkyrie class Hoverbot is one of the Council's more ingenious inventions. Rumor has it that Vandal was inspired by the Rikti attack drones, but there have been versions of the Valkyrie in service since the 1940's. Mounted with omni-directional jets and banks of armor piercing rockets, the Steel Valkyries are quite maneuverable and pack a deadly punch. They can make the skies a very dangerous place."
// DisplayNames :
"P3476939984" "Steel Valkyrie"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Fifth_Nightwolf 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1649882118" "The nature of the Nightwolves remains a terrifying mystery. These monstrous, werewolf like creatures were once human beings, but they have since been warped beyond all recognition. Unlike the Vampyri, these beasts are not the result of any known super serum treatment. Many suspect that some kind of magic is involved in their transformation."
// DisplayNames :
"P1105410566" "Nightwolf"
// DisplayNames :
"P2512800327" "Darkwolf"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Fifth_Nightwolf_Lt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3384927868" "The Nightwolf champion has lost all of his humanity to whatever force transformed him into a monstrous killing machine. Unlike the more sedate Nightwolf warriors, the champions are in a wild state and can barely be controlled. They are berserkers, unwilling to obey any orders when their enemy is in sight. They are, however, nearly impossible to kill, which makes up for their disobedient nature."
// DisplayNames :
"P749995770" "Nightwolf Champion"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Lt_Nightwolf_Lycan 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1231432022" "Some Nightwolves have mastered the ability to temporarily transform back into their human body. This allows these soldiers to infiltrate targeted facilities before revealing their monstrous nature. The authorities have little time to react once they realize what they're dealing with."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Boss_Nightwolf 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3572735420" "The Warwolf has lost all of his humanity to whatever force transformed him into a monstrous killing machine. Unlike the more sedate Nightwolf warriors, the Warwolves are in a wild state and can barely be controlled. They are berserkers, unwilling to obey any orders when their enemy is in sight. They are, however, nearly impossible to kill, which makes up for their disobedient nature."
// DisplayNames :
"P3814626281" "Warwolf"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Boss_Nightwolf_Lycan 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vampyr_Life_Drain 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1278400263" "The Vampyri are not true vampires at all. They are instead the ultimate result of the Council's super soldier program. It takes a full year of chemical treatments and surgical enhancements to create a single Vampyr, but the result is one of the most deadly killing machines in the world. All Vampyri have incredible strength, speed, and resilience. The Vampyr Parasite has the ability to drain life from its targets, while strengthening itself."
// DisplayNames :
"P546131332" "Vampyr Parasite"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vampyr_Mesmerist 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P223165452" "The Vampyri are not true vampires at all. They are instead the ultimate result of the Council's super soldier program. It takes a full year of chemical treatments and surgical enhancements to create a single Vampyr, but the result is one of the most deadly killing machines in the world. All Vampyri have incredible strength, speed, and resilience. The Vampyr Mesmerist has potent hypnotic abilities that entrance enemies and render them helpless."
// DisplayNames :
"P120702855" "Vampyr Mesmerist"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vampyr_Lt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P258289455" "The Vampyri Adjutants are soldiers who have been promoted from the Cor Leonis ranks and given the singular honor of becoming a Vampyr. This honor is one the masters of the Council are loathe to give, since it means a year of inactive duty for the Cor Leonis. The result, however, is a Vampyr who has both the power and the experience to lead his monstrous soldiers into battle."
// DisplayNames :
"P4044902666" "Vampyr Adjutant"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vampyr_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P14356326" "The Vampyri Archons are the assistants to Nosferatu, the man responsible for the Council's super soldier program. Vampyri Archons are scientists as well as super soldiers, and have a hand in the creation of other Vampyri. They often personalize their own transformation process, giving themselves special abilities and powers that lesser beings can only dream of. "
// DisplayNames :
"P1694734645" "Vampyr Archon"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Dark_Vampyr_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P447733285" "The Dark Vampyri are the assistants to Nosferatu, the man responsible for the 5th Column's super soldier program. They are scientists as well as super soldiers, and have a hand in the creation of other Vampyri. They often personalize their own transformation process, giving themselves special abilities and powers that lesser beings can only dream of. "
// DisplayNames :
"P211090139" "Dark Vampyr"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Wolfpack_Lt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2725995812" "The Mk I Wolfpack robot has been favorably compared to a battle tank when it comes to both firepower and resilience. The big difference is that the Mk I is controlled by an ingenious artificial intelligence that can capably command troops in the field. It carries enough firepower to take out heavily armored targets, and its own armor stands up to anything less than an anti-tank weapon."
// DisplayNames :
"P1644808757" "Mk I Wolfpack robot"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Wolfpack_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P47670056" "The ultimate in automated fighting systems, the Mk II Wolfpack robot is fearsome in combat, capable of taking on whole armored companies by itself. The robots' unerring aim and large caliber weaponry make them a threat to any hero they come across. Their enhanced AI allows them to coordinate with the Council's human troops, making them the perfect battlefield commanders. "
// DisplayNames :
"P3660354486" "Mk II Wolfpack robot"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Requiem 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P4253546519" "Ridolfo Uzzano has come a long way from his humble beginning as one of Mussolini's lapdogs. The primary cause of his success was his fusion with a Nictus, a being of utter darkness. The Nictus gave Ridolfo the ability to scorch his foes with an infernal fire. Though he is now over 100 years old, Requiem remains a fearsome foe in battle. Before the Center arrived to spoil his fun, Requiem ruled over the massive military organization now known as the Council. His closest attendents suspect that Requiem is still smarting from his loss of power, and plotting his revenge."
// DisplayNames :
"P2244170352" "Requiem"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Vandal 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2538508564" "The fiend known as Vandal was once a humble tinkerer named Othman Doul. In the late 1930's, the villain Requiem recognized Doul's usefulness and recruited him to produce the fabulous machinery that powers the Council's arsenal. Othman was happy to oblige, since it meant he could indulge his scientific curiosity without restraint. Over the years, Vandal has mechanically augmented himself to prolong his lifespan. Now, he seeks to advance his own position within the Council by pushing his terrible technology ever farther."
// DisplayNames :
"P1669497069" "Vandal"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Nosferatu 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3362505123" "Few truly appreciate the genius of Nosferatu's super soldier program, and none more so than himself. Nosferatu was so entranced by his ability to create the super strong Vampyri that he became one of them. He has since improved upon his original design by granting himself several new abilities. He can mesmerize his opponents, leaving them helpless. Some say he can even siphon off the life force of his foes. "
// DisplayNames :
"P1215451297" "Nosferatu"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Door 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1317399436" "This reinforced door stands between you and freedom!  The door seems to be vibrate and hum, as though it is coursing with energy."
// DisplayNames :
"P699576872" "Reinforced Door"

